WEBVTT

00:00:06.442 --> 00:00:07.450
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> It’s really hot.

00:00:08.006 --> 00:00:10.801
Would you like a drink? Or some ice cream?

00:00:11.111 --> 00:00:13.959
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> Yes, why not? Let’s go to the café.

00:00:19.173 --> 00:00:20.907
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> What kind of ice cream do you want?

00:00:21.343 --> 00:00:24.076
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> Um… an ice-cream bar if they have it.

00:00:25.607 --> 00:00:28.430
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> Here you are. One ice-cream bar.

00:00:28.558 --> 00:00:29.447
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> Thanks, Dave.

00:00:29.955 --> 00:00:30.934
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> Where do you live?

00:00:31.211 --> 00:00:33.483
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> I live near here, on Park Road.

00:00:33.714 --> 00:00:34.214
And you?

00:00:34.571 --> 00:00:36.970
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> I live across town, on Lake Street.

00:00:37.645 --> 00:00:39.067
What do you do, Becca?

00:00:39.281 --> 00:00:40.464
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> I’m a journalist.

00:00:40.703 --> 00:00:42.851
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> Really? How interesting!

00:00:43.223 --> 00:00:45.172
Do you work for a newspaper?

00:00:45.331 --> 00:00:46.760
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> No, for TV.

00:00:47.006 --> 00:00:48.046
What about you?

00:00:48.268 --> 00:00:49.225
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> I’m a teacher.

00:00:49.630 --> 00:00:50.987
I’m on vacation now.

00:00:51.336 --> 00:00:52.241
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> Me too.

00:00:54.494 --> 00:00:56.073
Oh! My ice cream.

00:00:56.105 --> 00:00:57.930
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> Dolly! Bad dog!

00:00:58.565 --> 00:00:59.795
I’m really sorry.

00:00:59.867 --> 00:01:00.960
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> That’s OK.

00:01:01.346 --> 00:01:03.268
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> Do you want another ice-cream bar?

00:01:03.398 --> 00:01:04.365
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> No, thanks.

00:01:04.711 --> 00:01:05.526
<v><b>Dave:</b></v> Are you sure?

00:01:05.902 --> 00:01:07.176
I’m really sorry.

00:01:07.713 --> 00:01:10.049
Look, let’s have lunch one day.

00:01:10.518 --> 00:01:13.037
I know a great place that’s dog-friendly.

00:01:13.665 --> 00:01:15.247
Are you free on Saturday?

00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:18.402
<v><b>Becca:</b></v> Oh, well, OK. Yes.

00:01:18.458 --> 00:01:19.137
Thanks.